<title>USA: Union Pacific Resources to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific Resources to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Pacific Resources Group Inc said it will buy back up to $50 million worth of the company's common stock in any fiscal year.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchase will not impact its previously announced capital spending program for 1997.</p>
<p>The company has about 250 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Officials there were not immediately available to comment.</p>
